    "id": "ghost-context-0-context",
    "source": "<b>Gertrude:</b> <indent=16%>Someday there will be a young girl in your care suffering the way you've suffered recently.</indent>\n<b>Gertrude:</b> <indent=16%>And you must protect her life with your last breath. Do you understand?</indent>\n<b>Brit:</b> <indent=16%>I do.</indent>\n<b>Gertrude:</b> <indent=16%>Now get up.</indent>\n<b>Brit:</b> <indent=16%>...",
