    "id": "ghost-context-1-context",
    "source": "<b>Ophelia:</b> <indent=16%>Yes. You did.</indent>\n<b>Ophelia:</b> <indent=16%>There's something I need to confirm. You also experience time repeating?</indent>\n<b>Ghost:</b> <indent=16%><i>I do.</i></indent>\n<b>Ophelia:</b> <indent=16%>In the graveyard, you told me to meet you here, now. But that was a different world.</indent>\n<b>Ghost:</b> <indent=16%><i>Yes. A world now forever locked behind time's barrier.</i>",
    "target": "<b>奥菲莉娅:</b> <indent=16%>是的。您认识我。</indent>\n<b>奥菲莉娅:</b> <indent=16%>有件事我需要确认。您也经历着时间的重复吗？</indent>\n<b>幽灵:</b> <indent=16%><i>是的，我也一样。</i></indent>\n<b>奥菲莉娅:</b> <indent=16%>在墓地里，您让我这个时候来这里见您。但那是在另一个世界里。</indent>\n<b>幽灵:</b> <indent=16%><i>是的。那个世界，如今已永远锁在时间的屏障后面。</i>",
