    "source": "<b>Rosie:</b> <indent=16%>So you'll speak with him?</indent>\n<b>Horatio:</b> <indent=16%>If my lady suggests it.</indent>\n<b>Rosie:</b> <indent=16%>I do.</indent>\n<b>Horatio:</b> <indent=16%>Then who am I to refuse?</indent>\n<b>Horatio:</b> <indent=16%>Thank you, Rosencrantz.",
