  {
    "id": "ghost-context-3-context",
    "source": "<b>Hamlet:</b> <indent=16%>As in, a... vision?</indent>\n<b>Ophelia:</b> <indent=16%>Y...Yes. Hamlet, you've got to trust me—please—</indent>\n<b>Hamlet:</b> <indent=16%>I do.</indent>\n<b>Hamlet:</b> <indent=16%>Is there anyone whom you suspect? Have you spoken to Bernardo about this?</indent>\n<b>Hamlet:</b> <indent=16%>Merely say the word, and he'll speak to anyone who troubles you. I'm certain he'll suss out ill intent.",
    "target": "<b>哈姆雷特:</b> <indent=16%>你是说……幻象？</indent>\n<b>奥菲莉娅:</b> <indent=16%>是……是的。哈姆雷特，你一定要相信我——求你了——</indent>\n<b>哈姆雷特:</b> <indent=16%>是的。</indent>\n<b>哈姆雷特:</b> <indent=16%>你有怀疑的人吗？你跟贝尔纳多说过这件事吗？</indent>\n<b>哈姆雷特:</b> <indent=16%>只要你开口，他就会去找那些让你不安的人谈谈。我相信他一定能查出谁心怀恶意。",
