  {
    "id": "ghost-context-4-context",
    "source": "<b>Irma:</b> <indent=16%>I never crossed paths with the woman. Gerta and I came to Elsinore after she had already perished.</indent>\n<b>Irma:</b> <indent=16%>There's a grave for her in the yard. You believe it to be empty?</indent>\n<b>Ophelia:</b> <indent=16%>I do.</indent>\n<b>Irma:</b> <indent=16%>Then this is a thread which presents too much danger for an old woman like me to be interested in pulling it.</indent>\n<b>Irma:</b> <indent=16%>Me, I stick to my drink and my cards and my cuisine, thank you!",
    "target": "<b>伊尔玛:</b> <indent=16%>我从没见过那个女人。格尔塔和我来到埃尔西诺时，她已经死了。</indent>\n<b>伊尔玛:</b> <indent=16%>墓地里有她的坟墓。你觉得里面是空的？</indent>\n<b>奥菲莉娅:</b> <indent=16%>是的。</indent>\n<b>伊尔玛:</b> <indent=16%>那这条线索追查起来就太危险了，我这样的老太婆可没兴趣碰。</indent>\n<b>伊尔玛:</b> <indent=16%>我嘛，还是喝我的酒、打我的牌、做我的菜吧，多谢了！",
    "origins": [
      {
        "asset": "scenes_present",
        "asset_sha256": "2b1c89384554b940e922d55352639e837524ba2b20d4d642ff3b85bca33bdbf2",
