  {
    "id": "ghost-context-5-context",
    "source": "<b>Ghost:</b> <indent=16%><i><i>It wasn't spoken of in my lifetime.</i></i></indent>\n<b>Ghost:</b> <indent=16%><i><i>Even Claudius and I have never passed her name between us. She... my mother...</i></i></indent>\n<b>Ghost:</b> <indent=16%><i><i>Terrible, bloody deeds were committed. My father was a cruel and greedy man.</i></i></indent>\n<b>Ghost:</b> <indent=16%><i><i>I do not know her whereabouts, but if she left Elsinore, she must have passed through town.</i></i></indent>\n<b>Ghost:</b> <indent=16%><i><i>But I am confined to these walls. I may not leave the board's edges.</i>",
    "target": "<b>幽灵:</b> <indent=16%><i><i>我生前，没有人谈论这件事。</i></i></indent>\n<b>幽灵:</b> <indent=16%><i><i>就连克劳狄斯和我，也从没对彼此提起过她的名字。她……我的母亲……</i></i></indent>\n<b>幽灵:</b> <indent=16%><i><i>有人犯下了可怕的血腥暴行。我的父亲是个残忍又贪婪的人。</i></i></indent>\n<b>幽灵:</b> <indent=16%><i><i>我不知道她的下落，但如果她离开了埃尔西诺，就一定经过了镇子。</i></i></indent>\n<b>幽灵:</b> <indent=16%><i><i>可我被困在这些城墙之内。我不能越过棋盘的边界。</i>",
